  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Land Administration Framework in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Shiraka project aims to provide the required additional financing to enable the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) inputs in the Twinning project &quot;Strengthening Land Administration Framework in Jordan&quot;.The overall objective of the Twinning project is strengthening the capacity of the Department of Lands and Survey (DLS) to manage land administration data and services effectively and transparently to provide accurate, up-to-date, and secured cadastral services.More specifically the Twinning project activities will enhance DLS&#x2019;s institutional and operational capacities by improving its operating framework and database model in line with applicable standards that will ensure cadaster information dependability and a better business environment.</narrative>
  </description>
